    <worksheet name='Daily VRH Line'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Average Daily Vehicle Revenue Hours</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>From the NTD Glossary (</run>
            <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://www.transit.dot.gov/ntd/national-transit-database-ntd-glossary#V&amp;quot;'>https://www.transit.dot.gov/ntd/national-transit-database-ntd-glossary#V</run>
            <run>):&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Vehicle Revenue Hours (VRH)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>The hours that vehicles are scheduled to or actually travel while in revenue service. Vehicle revenue hours include: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>•   Layover / recovery time.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Vehicle revenue hours exclude: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>•   Deadhead;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>•   Operator training;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>•   Vehicle maintenance testing; and</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>•   Other non-revenue uses of vehicles.</run>
            <run><![CDATA[

